  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">受苦於苦工毀壞你的建築？</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> Party Creepers</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 將每個爆炸變成慶典而非災難！當苦工引爆時，它會爆發出五彩繽紛的紙屑和煙火，這意味著您可以在保持苦工遭遇的刺激同時保護您的建築。無方塊破壞、無狼藉，只有樂趣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">您仍可調整派對的狂野程度：讓爆炸完全無害，選擇爆炸是否仍傷害玩家或生物，或用紙屑混合真實破壞來增加混亂與風格。一切皆可完全客製化，並透過簡單的實體標籤讓您選擇任何苦工以達最大靈活性。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎉 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">五彩紙屑爆炸：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦工在璀璨煙火中謝幕，而非摧毀方塊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選擇混亂等級：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">令爆炸無害或繼續對玩家及生物造成傷害。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌈 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自由搭配：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">結合煙火與普通爆炸以達到最大混亂效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">簡單設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">依個人喜好調整傷害規則、粒子效果與紙屑機率。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">支援所有苦工：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">partycreepers:explosive_creepers</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">標籤獲得完整相容性。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">伺服器須安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可於遊戲內透過模組選單直接設定（Fabric 需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 Mod Menu）。請注意，較舊版 Minecraft 也需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，檔名格式為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，依設定類型而定。並非所有模組皆存在所有類型設定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sr2610\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SR2610</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作富趣的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-confetti\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Creeper Confetti</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，啟發了本作的核心理念。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mob-plaques\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mobplaques/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mob-lassos\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/moblassos/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/partycreepers/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
